\"；② 命令前后插"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"随机 ID 标记行"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、只取两标记之间的内容，防上一条输出串进来；超时也把已收到的部分输出返回（状态 exact/timeout），不全丢。随机标记防串台是面试官会追问的细节。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-20kodfx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-20kodfx","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"E9 接口设计：错误码/响应体怎么设计？状态码就够了吗？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-a47w314","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-a47w314","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-na0gzg4","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-na0gzg4","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-spk8kap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-spk8kap","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：200 但 ok:false 的坑。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-a5u3y1c","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-a5u3y1c","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-6seb8b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-6seb8b0","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：HTTP 状态码表达传输语义、body 表达业务语义；错误体带机器可读 code+人可读 message；一致性最重要。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-c1v18xw","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-c1v18xw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-pjavcn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties