"，然后给\"如果上生产我会加：进程存活探针、上报量突增告警、磁盘水位告警\"——诚实+有方案，比编强。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-7z66awg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-7z66awg","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F. AI 应用开发（锚：Crash AI 分析流水线 / MCP / skills 工具链）"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-691n0eh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-691n0eh","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F1 什么是 Agent？工具调用（Tool Use）的完整流程是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-9txpct2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-9txpct2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-qwcaigp","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-qwcaigp","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-8frvd9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-8frvd9y","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：Crash 分析工具就是\"Agent+确定性流水线\"的结合体。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-oxz4gpx","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-oxz4gpx","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-2dvi9nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-2dvi9nn","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：Agent=LLM+规划+工具调用+反馈循环；流程：模型输出调用意图（结构化）→宿主校验并执行→结果回传→模型继续，直到产出最终答案；工程要点是 schema 定义、错误回传、循环上限、取消机制。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-4qdbb70","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4qdbb70","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-t6umsf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-t6umsf5","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：CrashMcpBridge 负责把 CDB 工具喂给模型，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CrashMcpCancellationToken"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 支持超时/用户取消掐断；但主流程是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"确定性规则优先"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、LLM 只做兜底叙述——\"Agent 不是全靠模型，能确定性做的绝不交给概率\"是你的核心观点。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-z45jzig","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-z45jzig","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F2 RAG、微调、提示词工程分别什么场景用？你们用哪种？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-ejhikt6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-ejhikt6","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-o9da8is","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-o9da8is","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-hzlxbbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-hzlxbbo","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：AI 岗必考三件套。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-82f8m3h","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-82f8m3h","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-h4eaw0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-h4eaw0q","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：RAG=外挂知识检索（知识会变/私有数据/需溯源）、微调=改模型行为分布（稳定格式/领域风格/量大）、提示词=轻量约束（成本最低先试）；工程上先提示词→不够再 RAG→再不够才微调。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-nn59vcm","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-nn59vcm","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-z6yejtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-z6yejtb","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：归因知识（企微 DLL 名册、场景规则）走 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"config.json 配置+规则引擎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而不是 RAG——数据量小、要求确定性可解释、需要可审计，比向量检索更对；LLM 只用在\"把证据组织成人话\"（userReply 客服话术）。\"什么时候不用 RAG\"答得出来才是真懂。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-3fi38n1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-3fi38n1","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F3 怎么抑制 LLM 幻觉？你们的证据链怎么设计？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-donfrj9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-donfrj9","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-4rnkkuw","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4rnkkuw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-1fa8599","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-1fa8599","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：evidenceList 技术证据+日志印证+分层取证。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-ehaz6tw","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-ehaz6tw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-bjki0n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-bjki0n8","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：让模型只基于给定证据归纳（受限生成）、要求引用出处、结构化输出+校验、确定性校验层复核关键结论、宁可\"无法分析\"不硬编。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-kkh3wi2","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-kkh3wi2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-u93kygc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-u93kygc","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：每组结论配四样：分类、置信度、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"evidenceList（可核对的技术证据）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、userReply；归因五层全是确定性规则（S3-A 栈顶→S3-B 前 20 帧降置信→S4 场景三层证据→S5 企微连续 ≥3 帧→R8 兜底\"无法分析保留证据\"）；空栈、证据冲突时输出 unable_to_analyze 而不是猜——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用\"不回答\"换准确率"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-cdvar9n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-cdvar9n","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F4 置信度怎么设计的？为什么分级？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-pihfl4m","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-pihfl4m","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-jxdhxsz","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-jxdhxsz","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-p8vhha2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-p8vhha2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：高/中/低/无法分析、置信度钳位、前 20 帧降置信。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-cs265g7","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-cs265g7","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-phvcqvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-phvcqvn","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：分级让下游可分级处置（高置信自动闭环、低置信人工复核）；置信随证据衰减（帧深度越深越不可信）、多信号叠加升/降级。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-49e3lki","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-49e3lki","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-p6txm47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-p6txm47","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：栈顶命中=高置信；前 20 帧扫描按帧深度"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"降置信"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\"仅加载未在栈\"=低置信、\"真在栈\"=中置信；未知模块连续 ≥2 帧才认（防劫持）；置信度钳位防溢出——一套可解释的证据→置信映射，比模型输出 0.87 可信得多。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-0ea52l8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-0ea52l8","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F5 上下文工程（Context Engineering）怎么做的？dump 很大怎么喂给模型？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-9zj6aa2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-9zj6aa2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-jjwek6c","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-jjwek6c","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-rjksqtq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-rjksqtq","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：元数据先行、避免全量 dump 进上下文。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-wfjmweo","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-wfjmweo","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-by122wx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-by122wx","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：上下文有限且贵；分层取材（先便宜的元数据再贵的全文）、结构化摘要代替原文、控制窗口、缓存复用。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-x19f0iw","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-x19f0iw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-w36l932","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-w36l932","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"crash_context.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 三件套——meta（先读元数据 JSON：CPU 型号、服务端已符号化的栈、崩溃时间、设备 ID，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"有符号化栈就跳过 CDB 上传和符号加载省几分钟"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）、logs（以崩溃时间为锚点按窗口取四类日志，只有覆盖崩溃时刻的才作证据，标出混入的其他案例目录）、grep（跳过加密日志和无关目录返回结构化结果）；CDB 只在需要寄存器/堆/其他线程栈时才走，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 首轮拿 80% 结论——\"先便宜后贵\"的取证顺序。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-trs79ib","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-trs79ib","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F6 提示词怎么组织？输出怎么保证稳定？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-mwethyw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-mwethyw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-9wtj4oq","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-9wtj4oq","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-3tn85xy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-3tn85xy","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：Gemini CLI 非交互桥接、prompt stdin vs 文件方案对比、JSON 结构校验。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-wp2iafg","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-wp2iafg","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-4y2kgot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4y2kgot","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：结构化提示（角色/任务/约束/示例/输出格式）、few-shot、输出 schema 校验+重试/修复回路；stdin vs 文件：长 prompt 用文件传防转义、stdin 便于管道化，各有取舍。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-ffr1z8w","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-ffr1z8w","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-j54ebhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-j54ebhx","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：非交互式调用 Gemini CLI 走桥接层，输出 JSON 做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结构校验"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不合法就重试；报告模板固定（归因结论、崩溃 dll 目录、按成本排序排查建议、dump 数与崩溃时间）——结构约束本身就是抗幻觉手段。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-b2w62px","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-b2w62px","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F7 Function Calling 的原理？工具 schema 怎么设计？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-d3sbvxn","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-d3sbvxn","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-6uqkwcp","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-6uqkwcp","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-zhh9kfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-zhh9kfw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：MCP 工具定义（tool_upload/tool_create_session/tool_session_exec…）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-o2kf5n1","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-o2kf5n1","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-wc5j218","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-wc5j218","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：schema 描述名字/参数/返回/错误，让模型准确选工具；设计原则：粗粒度少而清、参数少、错误信息可读可自愈、危险操作需确认。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-4tbq97g","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4tbq97g","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-9f5otv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-9f5otv2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：MCP 工具拆分=按用户心智（上传/建会话/执行/关闭）而非按内部函数；quick_triage 是\"3 秒快筛\"、深度分析是慢工具——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"快慢分层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让 Agent 先便宜探路再昂贵确认，工具粒度设计直接决定 Agent 好不好用。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-m99zxqb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-m99zxqb","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F8 规则引擎和 LLM 的边界怎么划？为什么归因用规则不用模型？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-r2gbxsn","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-r2gbxsn","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-k3dcuq2","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-k3dcuq2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-9yz0kig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-9yz0kig","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：确定性规则优先于 LLM 是你反复讲的设计决策。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-si56aba","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-si56aba","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-k3cuat2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-k3cuat2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：规则=可解释、可测试、确定、便宜、可灰度；模型=泛化、模糊匹配、贵、不可复现。边界：可枚举的判定给规则，开放性生成给模型。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-5gawh44","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-5gawh44","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-z5qzvcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-z5qzvcc","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：归因是\"可枚举的决策链\"（1 编排器+11 单一职责子方法、命中即返回），改一条规则可单测可回滚；LLM 只写客服话术（同标题话术合并一键复制）。规则改起来要发版是缺点——所以阈值外置（扫描帧数 20、连续帧 3）、规则配置化、设想远程开关。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-t7tvoqg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-t7tvoqg","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F9 规则引擎怎么组织的？为什么重构成\"1 编排器+11 子方法\"？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-87832dw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-87832dw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-9xanhgv","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-9xanhgv","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-3dcg7t1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-3dcg7t1","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：规则引擎重构是实习里明确的重构经历。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-eervav4","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-eervav4","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-65dztm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-65dztm7","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：决策链=编排器负责顺序、子方法单一职责、命中即返回；重构动机是嵌套分支不可测不可扩。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-6n2pgjz","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-6n2pgjz","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-fot0sf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-fot0sf6","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：重构前 if 层层嵌套、加一条规则要读懂全函数；重构后每个子方法可单测、新规则=加一个方法+注册顺序。还有插件化设想：Stage 接口（id+order+gate+run、返回空即未命中）、配置声明+工厂开关、Dart 无反射所以是\"配置驱动的编译期插件\"——答\"怎么让规则引擎可扩展\"直接展开。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-jv6haf9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-jv6haf9","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F10 怎么评测一个 AI 分析工具的好坏？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-5k1pmt1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-5k1pmt1","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-cgrqhgt","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-cgrqhgt","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-4l9uj0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4l9uj0u","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：26 个测试用例、分类准确率、not_helpful 统计。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-mgtdvwn","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-mgtdvwn","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-neldt90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-neldt90","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：离线指标（准确率/召回/分组质量）、在线指标（采纳率/负反馈率）、对抗样本、回归集；关键是要有标注数据。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-m4fycnd","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-m4fycnd","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-rhckm0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-rhckm0o","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：统计后台里 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"_calc_classification_not_helpful"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（分类负反馈率）、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"_calc_unable_to_analyze_breakdown"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（无法分析占比）就是线上评测指标——用户点\"没帮助\"直接回流改进规则；测试侧 26 用例六维度（功能/稳定/并发/异步/兼容/回归）；评测闭环是从\"统计口径\"设计开始的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ops_category_set_for_record"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 同一次分析同类只计一次，防口径虚高）。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-mjoh8d8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-mjoh8d8","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F11 AI 产品的数据隐私怎么处理？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-zw5knsl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-zw5knsl","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-jsv0ovk","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-jsv0ovk","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-d8qxxfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-d8qxxfb","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：数据最小化设计。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-et7pq0g","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-et7pq0g","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-obq59ie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-obq59ie","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：最小化采集、脱敏、留存期限、访问控制；dump 含用户隐私数据尤其敏感。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-uq9o4zi","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-uq9o4zi","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-4sjgsmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4sjgsmt","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：统计后台只存分类/厂商/结论/时间等摘要、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不存完整调用栈"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（数据最小化）；日志上传走内网+token 鉴权；MCP 服务能力能看任意 dump 所以必须 Bearer 鉴权——\"能力越强权限越要收紧\"。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-vw00bjk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-vw00bjk","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F12 用 AI 写代码/AI 辅助开发的经验？（AI 岗可能反向问你）"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-42jou4p","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-42jou4p","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-ss5v9hs","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-ss5v9hs","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-4lt80jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4lt80jl","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"触发点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：实习用了 skills、MCP 配置、Gemini CLI——AI 辅助开发本身是你的素材。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-ch5qz30","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-ch5qz30","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-fpxurox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-fpxurox","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：工具怎么融入工程流程、确定性在哪、怎么验证 AI 产出。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-q2smx3q","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-q2smx3q","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-m37qxzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-m37qxzy","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：crash-dump-analysis skill 把\"解压→读元数据→CDB→日志印证→归因→报告\"固化成可复用技能；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump_helper.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"/"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"crash_context.py"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是给 AI 用的确定性脚手架（AI 不直接裸跑 shell，跑封装好的脚本）；skill 设计经验（触发条件、步骤、scripts、references 拆分）——讲\"我是怎么让 AI 稳定干活的\"。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-ivf2cvu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-ivf2cvu","updated":"20261004120652"}},{"ID":"20261004120652-3ewbh7y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-3ewbh7y","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二部分 场景题"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-qjtm80h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-qjtm80h","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"G. 系统设计与方案取舍"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-7pvvuec","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-7pvvuec","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"G1 设计一个客户端日志系统，要求异步落盘、自动清理、进程被强杀尽量不丢。"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-06bbypn","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-06bbypn","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-kwkjah0","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-kwkjah0","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-smyyd0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-smyyd0r","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点骨架"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：分层（宏→RAII 收集→异步队列→sink 组合）→刷盘时机（Warn 即刷/缓冲满/退出刷）→清理两层（运行期数量上限+启动期日期兜底）→降级三级（写文件→调试窗口→静默）→异常安全（析构不抛、全 catch）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-kij26da","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-kij26da","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-c3tyhxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-c3tyhxy","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：直接用你的实现作答，主动给取舍：\"队列满选 block 不选丢弃=日志不丢优先；强杀丢队列是接受的降级，用三个刷盘时机压缩窗口\"。追问点：为什么清理在启动时做（强杀必然触发）；为什么按文件名日期不按 mtime。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-4dd47kx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4dd47kx","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"G2 设计一个大 dump 文件上传服务（几 GB、多人用、会重复传）。"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-jluu8q5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-jluu8q5","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-fm6lc79","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-fm6lc79","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-tf6ujby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-tf6ujby","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点骨架"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：流式上传（不进内存）→内容指纹预去重（本地先查再传）→断点续传+签名校验（防伪完整）→大小上限+413→鉴权（token）→服务端存储治理（水位淘汰 LRU、最少保留、临时目录清理）→幂等。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-0mi4qos","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-0mi4qos","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-uybpqxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-uybpqxf","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：8MB chunk、4GB 上限、SHA-1 分块 1MB、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"PUT /uploads/{token}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、sendTimeout 600s 且大文件不重试；服务端 FileManager 指纹存储+水位 80%→70% 淘汰（调试中的 dump 跳过、最少保留 5 个兜底）——从客户端到服务端一条链答全。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-3diuo1m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-3diuo1m","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"G3 给你 20 个 10GB 的 dump，3 秒内必须给初步结论，怎么设计？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-8plojde","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-8plojde","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-eju0d0g","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-eju0d0g","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-jjxtspl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-jjxtspl","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点骨架"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：不可能全量分析→分层快筛（元数据/头部信息/快速分类）→有界并发（在飞窗口）→先出粗结论再异步细化→降级路径。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-co9ydez","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-co9ydez","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-mib0q9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-mib0q9m","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：quick_triage 3 秒快筛三态（crash/suspected/non-crash）、预筛固定并发 2 在飞窗口、最多保留 5 个 crash 候选、非 crash dump 过滤、多 dump 按签名分组（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"groupBySignature"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）同组只深挖一次、深证可降级 fail-soft——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时间预算约束下的取舍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是这题的考点，主动讲\"我砍掉了什么、为什么这么砍\"。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-i4sk3fn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-i4sk3fn","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"G4 统计后台从 JSONL 迁移到 MySQL，怎么迁移？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-hl30abd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-hl30abd","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-zpcr9do","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-zpcr9do","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-m0maxu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-m0maxu4","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点骨架"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：双写过渡→历史数据导入（解析 JSONL 批量入库）→校验（条数/聚合对账）→切读→切写→回滚预案。口径问题比技术问题难：迁移前先固化统计口径。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-265al4t","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-265al4t","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-0ob5jcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-0ob5jcd","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ops_category_set_for_record"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"同一次分析同类只计一次\"这种口径必须先文档化，否则迁完数字对不上；迁移动机=数据量超内存、需要复杂查询、多写者。也讲反向理由：现在单机单写者 JSONL 未必需要迁（YAGNI）。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-0xjaqh4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-0xjaqh4","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"G5 会话/连接池怎么设计？上限、超时、清理怎么定？"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-uw9nqow","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-uw9nqow","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-e9sgnph","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":tru