{"id":"20261004120652-qgaheph","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-ezqn5ez","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-ezqn5ez","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-jhpoekh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-jhpoekh","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要点骨架"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：先肯定现有约束下的合理性→再给三条改进（按收益排序）→讲清为什么不一开始就那么做（约束：时间、风险、Dart 无反射）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-f0g0wv3","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-f0g0wv3","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-6q4jhsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-6q4jhsy","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"结合实习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：标准答法=① 规则引擎插件化（Stage 接口，现成设想直接讲）② 归档链路持久化挂起区+原子写（见 E5/G8）③ 上下文/取证层缓存（同机器同签名 dump 复用元数据）；要领："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"每个\"改进\"都对应一个真实踩过的坑"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，显得是复盘不是空想。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-49g5l22","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-49g5l22","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H. 压力追问与开放题"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-4d6evex","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-4d6evex","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H1 \"你这些里哪些是你独立做的？哪些是别人的？\"（必被问）"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-bij2qvs","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-bij2qvs","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-zxyfvjw","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-zxyfvjw","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-82b4kja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-82b4kja","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要领"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用\"我改了什么/我决策了什么/谁 review 推翻了我什么\"三层回答；能说出被推翻的决策（比如被 review 出的 6 条纠错）反而加分——说明真在团队里。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-o5jv4ra","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-o5jv4ra","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H2 \"你说的这些，换个实习生用 AI 是不是也能做出来？\""}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-gcv78ps","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-gcv78ps","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-q1rrhlt","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-q1rrhlt","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-o79anh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-o79anh2","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要领"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：不否认 AI 加速了实现，把价值挪到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"问题定义、取舍、验证、踩坑修复"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：半截包问题、Close vs DestroyWindow、锁内二次校验、时区差——这些是\"知道要做对的事\"，AI 给不了。AI 是我的杠杆不是我的替代。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-gee3zsl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-gee3zsl","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H3 \"你觉得你方案里最脆弱的地方是什么？\"（压力题，必准备）"}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-yr8u25i","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-yr8u25i","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-hr1m48e","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-hr1m48e","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-njd2am6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-njd2am6","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"标准答"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：各挑一个+修复方案：挂起区内存态可丢（→落盘）、重写非原子（→os.replace）、规则发版才能改（→配置化远程开关）、LLM 话术未校验事实性（→模板+证据引用约束）。主动交代弱点+方案=成熟度。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-kq5l126","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-kq5l126","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H4 \"这个功能线上出过事故吗？你怎么处理的？\""}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-a6wm69s","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-a6wm69s","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-1mni6q1","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-1mni6q1","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-l8dyf1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-l8dyf1g","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要领"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：讲真 bug 的暴露→定位→修复→防复发四段：单例弹窗 Close 丢提醒、构造参数 UB 隐患、会话泄漏、zip 路径穿越（安全修复：路径规范化折叠 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 后校验仍在解压根内、越界跳过并告警）——每个都有\"怎么发现的\"细节才可信。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-klvsx1l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-klvsx1l","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H5 \"为什么这么多东西都做了自动化/AI 化，人工分析不是更准吗？\""}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-kfwlp96","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-kfwlp96","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-0ti7843","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-0ti7843","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-p5rjrv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-p5rjrv9","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要领"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：人准但不可规模化、不可复现；目标是把人从 80% 机械劳动（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 80% 结论）解放出来只看难例；unable_to_analyze 就是\"承认人更强、把难例给人\"的分流设计。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-s8kxs8c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-s8kxs8c","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H6 \"给你一个完全不熟悉的领域（比如音视频/移动端），多久能上手？\""}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-76he6uz","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-76he6uz","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-5mcvwhh","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-5mcvwhh","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261004120652-o42y7a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-o42y7a8","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要领"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用实习里跨栈的事实答：三个月内横跨 C++/MFC、Dart/Flutter、Python 服务端、MCP/AI 四个技术栈；方法论=先读代码找范式照抄（照抄框架线程范式降低风险）、小改动先求零影响（加法式改动）、用测试用例固化认知。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20261004120652-qpgnk5x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-qpgnk5x","updated":"20261004120652"}},{"ID":"20261004120652-8z671yc","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-8z671yc","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20261004120652-xruxlje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004120652-xruxlje","updated":"20261004120652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最后提醒"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：所有题目答案以工作区真实代码和「6 条纠错事实」为准；被追问到不会的，答\"这块我没做那么深，我的边界是××，如果要做我会从××入手\"——不装，比装更稳。"}]}]}]}